            "recommendation": "Implement rate limiting for intake-agent. Bound concurrency, request rate and per-task spend for this component and shed load with a clear status. Place the control where free-text shipment requests are first received, so that nothing downstream has to repeat the check. This addresses: A single oversized or deeply nested payload makes intake-agent spend disproportionate memory and CPU parsing free-text shipment requests. Acceptance check: a load test above the configured limits is shed with a clear status while normal traffic keeps its latency budget. Ship to the internal environment first, compare behaviour with the previous release and promote after reviewing the first week of records. Suggested location: stub-codebase/src/intake_agent/rate_limiting.py. Reference patterns: Token buckets, bulkheads, circuit breakers, task budgets.",
